  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "７ひきの　オロチュが　みつあめでつくった　りんごのなかで　くらす。まんなかの　オロチュが　しれいとう。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "7마리의 미드라가 꿀엿으로 만든 사과 안에서 지낸다. 가운데에 있는 미드라가 사령탑이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "７隻蛇蟲蟲住在蜜糖製成的蘋果裡。由正中央的蛇蟲蟲發號施令。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sept « Verochi » vivent dans une pomme composée de nectar. Celui qui se trouve au centre est le chef du groupe.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sieben sogenannte „Schlangel“ leben in einem Apfel aus Nektar. Das Exemplar in der Mitte ist der Anführer.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se trata de siete seres llamados Viborappli que viven juntos en una manzana de caramelo. El del centro es el líder del grupo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sette creature dette Appliserpi vivono in un pomo fatto di melassa. L’Appliserpe al centro fa da comandante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Seven syrpents live inside an apple made of syrup. The syrpent in the center is the commander.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "７匹の　オロチュが　蜜飴で作った　りんごのなかで　暮らす。真ん中の　オロチュが　司令塔。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "７只蛇虫虫生活在由蜜糖制成的苹果中。由正中间的蛇虫虫负责发号施令。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se trata de siete seres llamados Viborappli que viven juntos en una manzana de caramelo. El del centro es el líder del grupo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "きまぐれな　オロチュたちの　よりあいじょたい。　まれに　きもちが　あうとほんらいの　ちからを　はっきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "변덕이 심한 미드라들의 집합. 드물게 마음이 맞으면 본래의 힘을 발휘한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "由善變的蛇蟲蟲們聚集同住在一起。偶爾心靈相通時，就會發揮出真正的力量。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ces « Verochi » capricieux vivent sous le même « toit ». En de rares occasions, ils parviennent à s’entendre et libèrent tout leur potentiel.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es entfaltet seine wahre Stärke, wenn sich die zusammenlebende launische Gruppe sogenannter „Schlangel“ ausnahmsweise mal einig ist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Unos Viborappli caprichosos que comparten morada. En raras ocasiones se ponen de acuerdo y son capaces de mostrar su verdadera fuerza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Un gruppo di Appliserpi capricciose che occupa un’unica dimora. Nelle rare occasioni in cui si trovano d’accordo, sfoderano la loro vera forza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "These capricious syrpents have banded together. On the rare occasion that their moods align, their true power is unleashed.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "気まぐれな　オロチュたちの　寄り合い所帯。　まれに　気持ちが　合うと本来の　力を　発揮する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
